將軍守武林，敗樓船軍數校尉，殺長吏。樓船將軍率錢唐轅終古斬徇北將軍，為御兒侯。自兵未往。","references":[{"title":"漢書顏師古注","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0007/blob/683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454/KR2a0007_095.txt#L411-L414","source_commit":"683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454","source_blob_sha":"b41576d7d677e481940c3a7f222a09837c85e8f7","response_sha256":"defa20130c3e1235164fab6d887a3f2b72894874b5658a6383ad028f356b344a","raw_quote":"尉殺長史樓船軍卒錢唐榬終古斬徇北將軍(師古曰/錢唐㑹)¶\n<pb:KR2a0007_WYG_095-23b>¶\n(稽縣也榬姓終/古名也榬音袁)為語兒侯(孟康曰越中地也今吳南亭/是師古曰語字或作篽或作)¶\n(禦其/音同)自兵未往故粤衍侯吳陽前在漢漢使歸諭餘善¶","quote":"榬姓終古名也","scope":"primary_commentary_reference_not_image_collation","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記・建元以來侯者年表》原列","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷020&oldid=2607036","quote":"六。元年閏月癸卯，莊侯轅終古元年。","table_id":"shiji-020","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r060-c06","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","scope":"received_table_person_identity","image_verified":false}],"note":"本篇轅終古按漢書顏師古所釋榬姓終古名對讀，姓氏原字仍用本篇轅；漢書榬字分源保留。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-114","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m008-0123","start":123,"end":126,"surface":"轅終古","kind":"person","person_id":"08e_bwz_ync","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-table-shiji020-r060-founding-grant","person_id":"08e_bwz_ync","title":"蘌兒侯","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","source_representation":"table_cells","evidence":[{"kind":"table_cell","table_id":"shiji-020","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r060-c00","quote":"蘌兒。","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","source_role":"fief_name"},{"kind":"tabl